If the same wedge is made rough then time taken by it to come down becomes $n$ times more. The coefficient of friction <img src="https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/2014_phy_a17.png">
$$
\begin{array}{l}
\mu=\left[1-\frac{1}{n^{2}}\right] \tan \theta \Rightarrow \mu=\left[1-\frac{1}{2^{2}}\right] \tan 45^{\circ} \\
\mu=\frac{4-1}{4} \Rightarrow \mu=\frac{3}{4}
\end{array}
$$
